Here is the commit message:
console: fix build error introduced at 11b15cf907e

Fixes NewAccountFormControllerTest, the call to
orgDao.findByCommonName(...) in NewAccountFormController is not
mocked up and resulted in NPE.

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the `NewAccountFormController` not properly mocking the call to `orgDao.findByCommonName(...)`, which resulted in a NullPointerException (NPE) when the method was invoked during the test. This occurred because the method was expected to return a valid `Org` object, but it returned null instead due to the lack of a mock setup.

Here is the patch:
